{"unit_id":"YardonYan__dsh-plugin-netease-lyrics#feature-1","repo":"YardonYan/dsh-plugin-netease-lyrics","commit":"f9dd3fc3f7a06adb3688719be803f5440733e4c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-netease-lyrics 的功能「状态行歌词」：读取网易云桌面播放信息，并将当前歌词插入 DSH 活动状态行旁。播放进度变化时切换对应歌词；活动状态行消失后歌词不显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["smtc-worker.ps1:21-47","client.js:223-260"]}
{"unit_id":"YardonYan__dsh-plugin-netease-lyrics#feature-2","repo":"YardonYan/dsh-plugin-netease-lyrics","commit":"f9dd3fc3f7a06adb3688719be803f5440733e4c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-netease-lyrics 的功能「歌词与翻译获取」：根据当前歌曲标题和歌手搜索网易云公开接口，获取 LRC 歌词与翻译并按时间合并。搜索遇到限流时会尝试备用搜索端点。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:107-130","index.js:168-199"]}
{"unit_id":"YardonYan__dsh-plugin-netease-lyrics#feature-3","repo":"YardonYan/dsh-plugin-netease-lyrics","commit":"f9dd3fc3f7a06adb3688719be803f5440733e4c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-netease-lyrics 的功能「悬停查看完整歌词」：鼠标移到状态行旁的歌词上时显示完整歌词及可用翻译；歌词区域不拦截下方控件的点击。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:193-221","client.js:239-260"]}
